      hu: ["Naltar volt az első hely Pakisztánban, ahol bevezették a síelést.", "A tavakat olvadó gleccservíz táplálja.", "A Satrangi-tónak állítólag hét különböző színe van.", "A völgy a burgonyatermesztéséről is ismert.", "A völgy magassága 2800 és 4000 méter között van.", "A völgyben található vízerőmű látja el árammal a Gilgit régiót.", "A Naltar név 'kék csillagot' jelent a helyi nyelven."],
      ro: ["Naltar a fost primul loc din Pakistan unde a fost introdus schiul.", "Lacurile sunt alimentate de apa topită a ghețarilor.", "Se spune că Lacul Satrangi are șapte culori diferite.", "Valea este, de asemenea, cunoscută pentru producția sa de cartofi.", "Altitudinea văii variază de la 2.800 la 4.000 de metri.", "O centrală hidroelectrică din vale furnizează electricitate regiunii Gilgit.", "Numele Naltar înseamnă 'stea albastră' în limba locală."],
      en: ["Naltar was the first place in Pakistan where skiing was introduced.", "The lakes are fed by melting glacial water.", "Satrangi Lake is said to have seven different colors.", "The valley is also known for its potato production.", "The altitude of the valley ranges from 2,800 to 4,000 meters.", "A hydroelectric power plant in the valley supplies electricity to the Gilgit region.", "The name Naltar means 'blue star' in the local language."]
